<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'Privacy'}) %><%- include('../partials/public-nav') %><main class="public-page"><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container narrow"><span class="eyebrow light">Privacy</span><h1>ReLoop Privacy Notice</h1></div></section><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container narrow prose"><p><b>Launch note:</b> This is an application baseline. Final public privacy wording should be reviewed for the operating legal entity and deployed infrastructure.</p><h2>Data ReLoop uses</h2><p>ReLoop may process account details, pickup locations, recycling records, collection proof, partner verification information, ratings, support requests and transaction status information needed to operate the service.</p><h2>Role-based access</h2><p>Collectors should only receive customer information necessary to complete assigned work. Partners receive delivery information relevant to their facility. Private proof files are restricted to authorized participants and ReLoop operations staff.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>Production deployment should use HTTPS, strong secrets, server-side sessions, access controls, backups and infrastructure monitoring.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Operational, financial and dispute records may require retention for accountability. ReLoop should finalize retention periods before public launch.</p></div></section></main><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
